    },
    {
      "id": "rmi-concrete-summary-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2529,
      "y": 4485,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 12054,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 880642311,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779951165635,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Il server registra RmiConnectionEntryPoint come MesosServer nel registry\n2. Il client fa lookup e ottiene lo stub RmiConnectionService\n3. ServerProxyRMI esporta VirtualServerRMI e chiama connect(callback)\n4. Il server crea VirtualViewRMI e ritorna lo stub RmiServerService\n5. Client -> server: RmiServerService.handleClientMessage(...)\n6. Server -> client: RmiClientService.handleMessage(...) sul callback",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Il server registra RmiConnectionEntryPoint come MesosServer nel registry\n2. Il client fa lookup e ottiene lo stub RmiConnectionService\n3. ServerProxyRMI esporta VirtualServerRMI e chiama connect(callback)\n4. Il server crea VirtualViewRMI e ritorna lo stub RmiServerService\n5. Client -> server: RmiServerService.handleClientMessage(...)\n6. Server -> client: RmiClientService.handleMessage(...) sul callback",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b3t"
    },
